'''Pablo''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Scarleton}}, on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Quest ==
'''Pablo''' will ask the player for a certain Flower to make Dyes. Once the player gives the specific Flower to Pablo, the player will gain {{Reputation|Mage|25}}.

;Flowers
*{{Item|Enchanted Dandelion}}: {{Green|45%}}
*{{Item|Enchanted Poppy}}: {{Green|45%}}
*{{Item|End Stone Rose}}: {{Green|10%}}

The quest can be completed once every {{Green|2 days}}.

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! colspan="2" | Condition
! Dialogue
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | First Interaction
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Hello.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: I am a modest painter.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Painting is a way to escape the harsh reality; I can create my own flawless world.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: I paint all sorts of things, but it costs a lot of colored dyes.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Could you help me and bring me some flowers? Most flowers cannot spawn on the &cCrimson Isle&f.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: I need a [item].
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | Without Item
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Could you bring me a [item]?}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | Incorrect Item
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: That is not the correct flower I'm looking for.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Bring me that [item] as soon as you can!
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: These paintings don't paint themselves!
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | Giving Correct Item<br>{{DG|First Interaction}}
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Thank you for supporting my passion.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: I often need flowers, feel free to come back in a few days.
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | Interacting With Correct Item
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Great, back to painting!}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | After Giving Correct Item
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: I can sense a great deal of virtue in you. You are a source of inspiration.}}
|-
