&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: &b✆&f Are you available? I desperately need a <item> today.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: &b✆&f Please meet me at my house if you have one. I would greatly appreciate it!
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Calling<br>{{DG|Without Item}}
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: &b✆&f Bring me that [flower] as soon as you can!
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: &b✆&f These paintings don't paint themselves!
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Calling<br>{{DG|After Giving Correct Item}}
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: &b✆&f I don't need any flowers at the moment!}}
|-
| class="ct" | Calling<br>{{DG|As a [[Factions#⚒%EF%B8%8F_Barbarian_Faction|{{DG|⚒ Barbarian}}]]}}
| {{Dialogue|&c✆ No answer.}}
|-
| class="ct" |Obtaining {{Item|The Soup}}
| class="ct" |Given any soup
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Thank you so much.
&e[NPC] &5Pablo&f: Here, I want you to have another painting.
&aYou claimed a The Soup!
}}
|}

== Trivia ==
*The name Pablo is a reference to the famous painter [[w:Pablo Picasso|Pablo Picasso]].

