{| class="wikitable"
! Condition
! Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" | None
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: Hello traveler!
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: Kuudra will return one day but we must first put aside our differences and be ready.
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: We must show Kuudra that we stand united for its return.
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Wearing [[Ember Armor|Ember]] or [[Rekindled Ember Armor]]
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: Hello traveler!
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: That's a very impressive armor set you are wearing, Kuudra would be impressed!
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: Kuudra will return one day but we must first put aside our differences and be ready.
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: We must show Kuudra that we stand united for its return.
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Claiming [[Kuudra Follower Chestplate]]
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: We are united! Kuudra SHOW YOURSELF TO US.
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: ...
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: ...
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: ...
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: Why didn't it show itself...
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: Maybe it won't ever return...
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: Thank you for your dedication adventurer, here is a token of my gratitude.
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Showing [[Unpleasant Kuudra Teeth Plaque]] without a [[Kuudra Pet]] equipped
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: &rI see you holding something there...
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: &rAnd it seems as though you need some assistance.
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: &rI would be able to provide it, but you came without the correct friend.
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Showing [[Unpleasant Kuudra Teeth Plaque]] with a [[Kuudra Pet]] equipped
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: &rAh yes! You are here with the right companion.
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: &rIt seems as though I can now properly assist you.
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: &rLet me go ahead and help you break down that item.
&e[NPC] &cArch&f: &rI wish you luck on your journey, adventurer!
}}

|}

